===Etymology 1===
From {{af|en|un-|done}}.

====Adjective====
{{en-adj|-}}

# Not [[done]].
#* {{RQ:Orwell Animal Farm|6
|passage=Even so, it was found necessary to leave certain tasks '''undone'''.}}

